ading-snug line-clamp-2 uppercase tracking-tight\">The American housing market is broken—and 3 years in, it’s starting to look permanent - Fortune</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[9px] font-black text-muted-foreground uppercase opacity-40\">5/11/2026</p></a><a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE1XMWNxSHJrSVpZUFdhcm1SN0FKbkpaYTR3V195dS1rTWhQY0dCWEhDT1ZlYkNlMi13aG5BdXpEN200UmhsRDZ2WDg1dEZyLTE3YjZuYi1HeWxSV0lvUkswbEM1bXRhN3dCeTBvU1Vn?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-2xl border border-border/40 bg-card/20 p-5 transition-all hover:bg-indigo-500/5 hover:border-indigo-500/40 shadow-xl border-l-2 border-l-turquoise-500 group\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors mb-2\">Market News</p><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground leading-snug line-clamp-2 uppercase tracking-tight\">Mortgage Rate History: 1970s To 2026 - Bankrate</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[9px] font-black text-muted-foreground uppercase opacity-40\">5/7/2026</p></a><a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQWGUxcGZLNkNZSTVfYlhnTnFDM1kyNHZfQWlteG9wUlM5N3BmWGN3RXBZSXNZc3BXZkpuamRaV1Nsc29DV3JlY3dGRXAzV2h4MEYtRVpwUVVSNTVvRTM0VjFpeVVvY2MySmdXUS1xVXMwVTZCMTRyVXlfYkpCUTR5OGYxWFBhcEtmaGVoandMYjFNdUNVWU5wODB5V05Va0p3YVNpVEtZUl9LLWh1VUE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-2xl border border-border/40 bg-card/20 p-5 transition-all hover:bg-indigo-500/5 hover:border-indigo-500/40 shadow-xl border-l-2 border-l-turquoise-500 group\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors mb-2\">Rocket Mortgage</p><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground leading-snug line-clamp-2 uppercase tracking-tight\">Rocket Companies Announces First Quarter 2026 Results - PR Newswire</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[9px] font-black text-muted-foreground uppercase opacity-40\">5/7/2026</p></a><a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQbWFkNWRPZERHRmFVS2U4Y1YzNUJVVTlRNy1uNHBfY19FNGJ1SlY3QmhScFlEWTlWekJ5VjlBZURMeXc0clVjWUY1MnpMSzNrckFpRHJRRzE0TzdNanlHSV8xMXVBVXdQZDVrTHh4aFl2UVB4T1hmOUw5ZkVQRUtKWmp6N0h0QmFXRFNIQzRma1FScG9Kam5ZMmZmYndhY09LazlIMA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-2xl border border-border/40 bg-card/20 p-5 transition-all hover:bg-indigo-500/5 hover:border-indigo-500/40 shadow-xl border-l-2 border-l-turquoise-500 group\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors mb-2\">Rocket Mortgage</p><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-foreground leading-snug line-clamp-2 uppercase tracking-tight\">Rocket Leans Further Into Servicing And Borrower Retention In Q1 - National Mortgage Professional</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-[9px] font-black text-muted-foreground uppercase opacity-40\">5/8/2026</p></a></div></section><section class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4\">About Ellis &amp; West Capital Lending</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-slate-300\"><p>At West Capital Lending, I shop around with <strong class=\"text-cyan-300\">hundreds of approved lenders and investors wholesale pricing</strong> to secure the best rates and terms — so you don&#x27;t have to. With an <strong class=\"text-emerald-300\">A+ BBB rating and five-star reviews</strong> across multiple platforms, our reputation speaks for itself.</p><p>Whether you&#x27;re purchasing your first home, a commercial property, or seeking cash-out options like <strong class=\"text-violet-300\">HELOCs, reverse mortgages, or hard-cash money loans</strong>, I custom-tailor each loan to fit your unique financial profile.</p><p>Our <strong class=\"text-fuchsia-300\">closing times are substantially faster than industry averages</strong>, ensuring a seamless experience from start to finish.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-emerald-800 bg-emerald-900/20 p-3\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400\">BBB Rating</p><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-emerald-300\">A+</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-violet-800 bg-violet-900/20 p-3\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-400\">Reviews</p><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-violet-300\">5 Stars</p></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mb-4\">Professional Resources</h3><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:bg-slate-800/60 group\" href=\"https://www.westcapitallending.com/team/Ellis-Andersen\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">👤</span><div><p class=\"font-medium text-slate-100 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition\">View My Profile</p><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">West Capital Lending team page</p></div></div></a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:bg-slate-800/60 group\" href=\"https://www.westcapitallending.com/\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">🏢</span><div><p class=\"font-medium text-slate-100 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition\">West Capital Lending</p><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">Company information &amp; credentials</p></div></div></a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 p-4 transition hover:border-cyan-400/50 hover:bg-slate-800/60 group\" href=\"https://heloc.westcapitallending.com/account/heloc/register?referrer=c6b56b11-3f54-4719-83bc-964085a31e87\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span cl